    "body": "fix on issue/2818-viewport-display-menu · PR #2835 · pinned by ui::draw_list::tests, egui_app::tests::display_menu, layout_window_display_menu, display_button_toggles_the_menu_and_wire_works_from_each_mode, gpu_render::shaded_drops_the_wire_and_hidden_edges_add_the_far_wire, view_file::the_display_mode_and_the_grid_round_trip_and_an_old_file_loads_the_defaults · merges at the next cut\n\nThe PR has the Display menu, the four display modes, \"Look at a face\", the grid switch, the origin axes switch and the projection.\nThe PR does not have the quality preset, the ground shadow, the ambient occlusion and \"Look at\" for a plane that is not a model face. Issue #2834 has these parts.\nThe fourth mode of #2636 (\"Wireframe, see-through\") is not in the PR. #2636 stays open.\n",
